--- /dev/null
+++ library/pkgIndex.tcl	2026-08-01 10:10:00.000000000 +0800
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Static-package bridge (OHOS): Thread is statically linked into tclsh/tcltest
+# and registered via Tcl_StaticPackage in tclAppInit.c (see 0010 patch).
+# Child interps created by "interp create" need this ifneeded entry so that
+# "package require Thread" resolves to "load {} Thread" (static load) instead
+# of searching for a loadable library. The core test unix/tests/thread.test
+# (thread-7.16/7.17) creates such a child interp inside a worker thread; without
+# this bridge that require fails, the worker dies, and the main thread's vwait
+# never returns (hang).
+package ifneeded Thread 2.8.9 [list load {} Thread]
